        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "I'd make the win condition less \"the heroes stop the bad guys\" and more \"the heroes stop the bad guys from getting away with the loot\".\n\nThey can still be tracked back to their lair, but if their health gets too low or any of them are knocked out, they take off early. Then, if the Red Zone runs out, they get away, take whatever it was they were trying to steal, and the lair fight becomes a lot more *interesting*.",
